      "id": "claim_20ec7da5b3344a48aaaa0553324927cb",
      "statement": "celld nodes share state through one object-storage bucket: a node claims a cell with a conditional write to an ownership record so exactly one node owns a cell at a time, and expired claims release cells without any membership protocol, failure detector, or consensus service.",
