      "id": "claim_a11d8c466ad34498967566624acd726b",
      "statement": "The workspace divides ownership three ways: crates/logic is a pure dependency-free decision core owning all behavioral state, crates/celld is only an effect-executor and adapter host whose futures never borrow core state and reply through the Actor mailbox, and crates/ltx is the SQLite replication library.",
