      "id": "claim_578a7a7a0e5948b3ba9ff0b43488d359",
      "statement": "Every activation advances the fencing epoch, and replicated data is written under cells/<cell>/ltx/e<epoch>/, so a stale owner's late writes land in a superseded prefix; a takeover whose dead owner's folded log state is unsealed must emit RecoverNodeLog before the claim proceeds.",
