      "statement": "Each cell has its own SQLite database file (scope-keyed, synchronous under async JS) captured by an in-process LtxRepl managing one celld_ltx::Db per resident cell with its own object-store client carrying the fleet key prefix, so two fleets sharing one bucket do not replicate over each other.",
