      "statement": "The output gate is one choke point: any egress that can reveal cell state arrives as Event::Output with the committed WAL position, and the core withholds it behind a per-write AwaitDurable barrier; read-only outputs trail the newest open barrier and release immediately when nothing is outstanding.",
